==Summary==
* GameTooltip related APIs have been significantly overhauled. Refer to the [[#Tooltip Changes|Tooltip Changes]] section for more details.
* Many bag container related APIs have been moved to the <code>C_Container</code> namespace. Additionally, some of these functions now return structured tables instead of multiple values.
* A new general-purpose {{api|t=a|UnitTokenFromGUID(unitGUID)}} function has been added for mapping a [[GUID|unit GUID]] to a [[UnitId|unit token]].

